</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="60" y="-90" /><onsuccess>3ab6050b-fa15-4b8a-b8ad-00693c61023f</onsuccess><processid>7def971b-0e5b-46ca-83cd-cbb1cdc377c7</processid></stage><stage stageid="ea14a8cf-a3e6-4ebc-9e6a-862b74bd2c19" name="terminate" type="SubSheet"><subsheetid>ce115056-2162-4177-9d61-f490fc2e1c74</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="75" y="-60" /><onsuccess>7f5bb0b1-c39c-4e7b-9053-7a71454748b2</onsuccess><processid>7def971b-0e5b-46ca-83cd-cbb1cdc377c7</processid></stage><stage stageid="2674f955-bb00-4a1c-b29e-ce0e581d6ed2" name="send email" type="SubSheetInfo"><subsheetid>f2c30dd0-b728-4e09-b226-b76bce8cbdba</subsheetid><display x="-465" y="-210" w="150" h="90" /></stage><stage stageid="5696c5c6-c690-464e-a50a-c57bb1317957" name="Start" type="Start"><subsheetid>f2c30dd0-b728-4e09-b226-b76bce8cbdba</subsheetid><display x="-30" y="-150" /><onsuccess>6c426fa4-0270-4b60-b9ce-dac3d43ef26c</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="459c5a1c-b006-4284-80e4-4cb5c4497d2c" name="End" type="End"><subsheetid>f2c30dd0-b728-4e09-b226-b76bce8cbdba</subsheetid><display x="-30" y="90" /></stage><stage stageid="6c426fa4-0270-4b60-b9ce-dac3d43ef26c" name="Send Email" type="Action"><subsheetid>f2c30dd0-b728-4e09-b226-b76bce8cbdba</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><narrative>The Data collection contains the items to be added to the queue. The collection may contain single or multiple rows, with each representing an item to be added.

If there is a failure during the process, the queue will be unchanged - i.e. no rows will be loaded even if the error occurred on the last one.

If Defer Until is specified, the items will not be available to be worked until then. Otherwise, they are available immediately.

If the queue has a key field defined, an item added has key data longer than the maximum permitted 255 characters, an error will occur</narrative><display x="-30" y="-45" /><inputs><input type="text" name="To" friendlyname="To" narrative="Mandatory. Any alphanumeric value allowed. Single Recipient = &quot;Name1@emaill.com&quot;; Multi Recipient = &quot;Name1@emaill.com; Name2@email.com&quot;" expr="[Receiver Email]" /><input type="text" name="CC" friendlyname="CC" narrative="Optional. Any alphanumeric value allowed. Single Recipient = &quot;Name1@emaill.com&quot;; Multi Recipient = &quot;Name1@emaill.com; Name2@email.com&quot;. Default blank" expr="" /><input type="text" name="BCC" friendlyname="BCC" narrative="Optional. Any alphanumeric value allowed. Single Recipient = &quot;Name1@emaill.com&quot;; Multi Recipient = &quot;Name1@emaill.com; Name2@email.com&quot;. Default blank" expr="" /><input type="text" name="Subject" friendlyname="Subject" narrative="Optional. Any alphanumeric value allowed." expr="[Subject]" /><input type="text" name="Message" friendlyname="Message" narrative="Optional, HTML or plain text" expr="[Exception Type]&amp;&quot;: &quot;&amp;NewLine()&#xA;&amp;[Exception Detail]" /><input type="text" name="Attachments" friendlyname="Attachments" narrative="Optional, Semicolon--separated file paths. Default blank." expr="" /><input type="flag" name="IsHTML" friendlyname="IsHTML" narrative="Optional. True or False, default to True" expr="" /><input type="number" name="Sensitivity" friendlyname="Sensitivity" narrative="Optional. An integer between 0 and 3, default to 0." expr="" /><input type="number" name="Importance" friendlyname="Importance" narrative="Optional. An integer between 0 and 2 default to 1." expr="" /><input type="text" name="Account Display Name" friendlyname="Account Display Name" narrative="Optional. DisplayName of the email account. Default account is used if omitted." expr="" /><input type="text" name="Shared Mailbox" friendlyname="S